  "raw_label": "postponed_or_procedural",
  "texts": {
    "preamble": "Pankaj Kakoty vs The State Of Assam And 6 Ors on 4 December, 2024 Author: Nelson Sailo Bench: Nelson Sailo Page No.# 1/3 GAHC010253062024 undefined THE GAUHATI HIGH COURT (HIGH COURT OF ASSAM, NAGALAND, MIZORAM AND ARUNACHAL PRADESH) Case No. : WP(C)/6308/2024 PANKAJ KAKOTY PRESENTLY HOLDING THE POST OF INSPECTOR OF DRUGS, HEALTH AND FAMILY WELFARE DEPARTMENT, ASSAM S/O LATE KAMAL KAKOTY, RESIDENT OF RUKMINI NAGAR, HOUSE NO. 8, BALIBAT, DISPUR, PS DISPUR DIST KAMRUPM ASSAM VERSUS THE STATE OF ASSAM AND 6 ORS REPRESENTED BY THE COMMISSIONER AND SECRETARY TO THE GOVT. OF ASSAM,HEALTH AND FAMILY WELFARE DEPARTMENT, DISPUR GUWAHATI 06 2:THE COMMSSIONER AND SECRETARY TO THE GOVT. OF ASSAM HEALTH AND FAMILY WELFARE DEPARTMENT DISPUR GUWAHATI 06 3:THE COMMISSIONER OF FOOD SAFETY AND DRUG ADMINISTRATION ASSAM BANPHOL PATH GUWAHATI 06 4:THE PRINCIPAL SECRETARY TO THE GOVT. OF ASSAM FINANCE DEPARTMENT DISPUR GUWAHATI 06 Pankaj Kakoty vs The State Of Assam And 6 Ors on 4 December, 2024 Indian Kanoon - http://indiankanoon.org/doc/27311881/ 1 5:THE DIRECTOR OF HEALTH SERVICES ASSAM HENGRABARI Page No. GUWAHATI 36 6: THE DRUGS CONTROLLER ASSAM HENGRABARI GUWAHATI 36 7:PUJA DEBNATH PRESENTLY HOLDING THE POST OF INSPECTOR OF DRUGS KARIMGANJ ASSAM C/O SHRI BISWAJIT DEBNATH RESIDENT OF HOUSE NO. 06 SILCHAR PO RANGIRKHARI PS RANGIRKHARI DIST CACHAR ASSAM 78800 Advocate for the Petitioner : MR. K N CHOUDHURY, MR. M AHMED,MR. D J DAS Advocate for the Respondent : SC, HEALTH, SC, FINANCE BEFORE HONOURABLE MR. JUSTICE NELSON SAILO ORDER 04.12.2024 The instructions received by Mr. B. Gogoi, learned counsel for the Health Department is that the service of the petitioner was extended only till 14.11.2023 and therefore, according to the Department, the petitioner is no longer in service.",
    "facts": "",
    "arguments": "On the other hand, Mr. K.N. Choudhury, learned Senior Counsel submits that although an attempt was made by the relievers to join the post occupied by the petitioner, the Joint Director of Health Services has informed the Commissioner and Secretary, Government of Assam, Health and Family Welfare Department that there is no vacant post for the reliever to join since the petitioner is holding the post."
  },
